      "description": "Signature list: rows in one hairline frame, Wash on hover, chevron. No fill, no lift, nothing leading the title.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-list\"><a class=\"ds-row\" href=\"#\"><span class=\"ds-row-title\">Boulder</span><span class=\"ds-row-meta\">Mån 6 okt</span><span class=\"ds-chev\">›</span></a><a class=\"ds-row\" href=\"#\"><span class=\"ds-row-title\">Board</span><span class=\"ds-row-meta\">Ons 8 okt</span><span class=\"ds-chev\">›</span></a></div>",
      "css": ":host{--bg:oklch(0.16 0.018 255);--card:oklch(0.20 0.022 255);--card2:oklch(0.235 0.026 255);--wash:oklch(0.27 0.03 255);--rule:oklch(0.305 0.03 255);--ink:oklch(0.95 0.008 255);--muted:oklch(0.73 0.02 255);--dim:oklch(0.55 0.025 255);--ember:oklch(0.72 0.17 40);--glow:oklch(0.72 0.17 40 / 0.25);--shadow:oklch(0 0 0 / 0.45);--boulder:oklch(0.78 0.14 55);--board:oklch(0.75 0.12 245);--routes:oklch(0.78 0.13 165)} .ds-list{font-family:Geist,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;width:420px;border:1px solid var(--rule);border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden}.ds-row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:12px 16px;color:var(--ink);text-decoration:none;transition:background-color .18s}.ds-row+.ds-row{border-top:1px solid var(--rule)}.ds-row:hover{background:oklch(0.27 0.03 255 / .6)}.ds-row:focus-visible{outline:none;box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 3px oklch(0.72 0.17 40 / .5)}.ds-dot{width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--c)}.ds-row-title{font-weight:500;font-size:15px}.ds-row-meta{margin-left:auto;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ds-chev{color:var(--muted);transition:transform .18s}.ds-row:hover .ds-chev{transform:translateX(2px)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Choice Chips",
